    "blurb": "Faster, smarter, compliant supplier onboarding",
    "overview": "Accelerates approval, automate compliance checks, and ensure clean master data. Achieve faster vendor creation, reduce risk, and unify ERP visibility with intelligent AI orchestration.",
    "rating": null,
